From: eeatminds <12shreyas86@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 07:52:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] Link: survive dropped connections; safe exits when the
 partner is gone

- The friend meeting sends each side's number back, so leftovers from an
  earlier try can't pass for the partner; better random numbers.
- Blocks wait in an outbox while the connection to the app is down and
  go once it's back (reconnects twice a second, by the wall clock).
- Once linked the games wait as long as on a cable; a partner gone for
  good is reported by the app ("no partner") and kept until the next
  session.
- Partner gone: a link battle ends as if they ran; in the trade center
  their answer reads as no / cancel, so nothing is traded without their
  own yes.
- Option changes no longer restart the link unless its own settings
  change.
- Link events go to the frontend's log.
