Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Link: friend meeting for the app's in-place routine in
 Red, Blue and Yellow

The app can start a trade or battle right where two players stand: it
points the current map's script at a short routine in work RAM. That
routine's first byte is the friend meeting (the same rendezvous as at the
receptionist), going on at the next byte when the friend is there or at
the routine's "done" exit when not.

